function dataGovDefinition(){return '\u201cFormally governed\u201d means a data system has a named owner, the data standards that apply to it have been selected, and it has been checked against them. \u201cPartially governed\u201d means it has an owner and standards but no check yet, or a failed check with a plan in place. \u201cUngoverned\u201d means it has no owner, no standards selected, or a failed check with no plan.'}
