  h+='<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.65;margin-top:10px;max-width:760px">This map shows which national and supranational laws reach each component, where its data sits and is computed, and where that is not known. It does not say what any of those laws permit, or whether a crossing matters to your organization\u2019s obligations.</div></div>'; /* R-7 (Paul's ruling, 9 Sep 2026): what the map shows and does not */
