    "agGovernance": {"mode":"standards","principles":["No application acts on a customer’s account, a price, or a payment without a person approving the action.","Every AI action that touches a customer or a system of record is logged with the input, the output, and who acted on it.","An agent reaches only the systems named on its card, through its own governed identity; shared and personal credentials are not permitted.","A person reviews the output of every application and agent on a schedule the card states, and every autonomous action is audited at least weekly.","Every application and agent has a named incident path that can stop it within the hour."]},
